    "Condition : 1 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved drawings and specifications, detailed PP-14997494v1 (Location Plan, Site Address: Sally Salon Services, Arch 72, Queens Circus, London, SW11 8NE) dated 09-Jun-2026; DE-SF-05-A rev 05 (PROPOSED SIGNAGE DETAIL) dated 23/07/26, unless approved otherwise in writing by the local planning authority. \r\nReason: To ensure a satisfactory standard of development and to allow the local planning authority to review any potential changes to the scheme. \r\n",
